Icon values were not as unicodes everywhere, with the printable rune. It was inconsistent, and it was hard to validate any changes in case folks dont have nerd font in editor. 
Now the data is more clearly defined.

I understand that these fixes are "not needed" in a way, but I am trying to improve the codebase whenever I feel it should be improved. It would make code more maintainable, easier to change, easier to understand in the long run.

Used this go code to do this

